        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cogen unit 160kWe, common components for heat+electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cogen unit 160kWe, common components for heat+electricity
The module summarises infrastructure components of a cogeneration unit. ;
UUID: edcd9e24-f73c-3e18-b9f7-465ef785d2e2
The module includes all shared components for heat and electricity production. Includes also three-way catalytic converter.
Location: Data refers to a plant in Switzerland, assumed valid for Europe (RER)
Technology: Infrastructure of a specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_edcd9e24-f73c-3e18-b9f7-465ef785d2e2.xml</text>
